    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Wild Dose is a first-person horror game set between an oppressive megalopolis and virtual drug sessions. Thanks to an evolving dialogue system, you'll meet a cast of characters with conflicting goals and make choices that will shape this fractured world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lost your job. Lost your apartment. Lost everyone.<br>Just you \u2014 ready to take on any contract to avoid sleeping on the streets \u2014 and your trusty AI, endlessly repeating the same ad: Fresh Air\u2122 \u2013 Let Nature come to you!<br>But you\u2019ve heard a rumor.<br>A black market program, spreading quietly.<br>Illegal. Unstable. Liberating.<br>They call it Wild Dose. No license. No limits. No tech support.<br>Just total disconnection.<br>And really\u2026 what do you have left to lose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555790/extras/cd708942718374a4c4991a88647cb702.poster.avif?t=1753484007\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555790/extras/cd708942718374a4c4991a88647cb702.webm?t=1753484007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555790/extras/cd708942718374a4c4991a88647cb702.mp4?t=1753484007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lose your grip on reality</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between suffocating streets, digital hallucinations, and unsettling encounters.<br>This city means you harm.<br>But are your toxic trips any safer than its alleyways?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555790/extras/94e41d0f67e6f05c1aa9bdfa100d9a40.poster.avif?t=1753484007\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555790/extras/94e41d0f67e6f05c1aa9bdfa100d9a40.webm?t=1753484007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555790/extras/94e41d0f67e6f05c1aa9bdfa100d9a40.mp4?t=1753484007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Nothing will ever be the same</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The population has grown tired of legal virtual drugs.<br>A storm is brewing.<br>And you're running out of time, money... and sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An immersive environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world of Wild Dose reacts to how you play.<br>Choose your approach for each mission: stealth, dialogue, or confrontation.<br>The decisions you make, the factions you support, and the relationships you build will shape the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A psychological nightmare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reality fades. Your senses deceive you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unforgiving narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick a side. Lives will be shattered \u2014 maybe even yours.<br>You can always escape into the virtual to forget this merciless reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555790/extras/7a3aa43689421d40b90179883e573e51.poster.avif?t=1753484007\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555790/extras/7a3aa43689421d40b90179883e573e51.webm?t=1753484007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555790/extras/7a3aa43689421d40b90179883e573e51.mp4?t=1753484007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
